    {
      "id": 8929762115841,
      "title": "The Binding of Isaac: Repentance+",
      "handle": "repplus",
      "body_html": "<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Repentance_store_1.png?v=1761605807\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Repentance_store_2.png?v=1761605814\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Repentance_store_3.png?v=1761605821\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Experience <em>The Binding of Isaac</em>’s devious blend of dungeon crawling, twin-stick shooter action and endlessly randomized replayability like never before: with friends online!</p>\n<p><em>Repentance+</em> includes the entire game<meta charset=\"utf-8\">—with all DLCs and hundreds of additions and improvements from updates—plus full-featured online co-op for up to four players.</p>\n<p>Play online with friends, start or join a match with strangers... and take on Mom and the twisting labyrinths of the Basement, together at last.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Online play in all game modes, including daily runs, Greed mode and challenges</li>\n<li>Extensive preference filters when hosting or searching for online matches</li>\n<li>Emote wheel and voice chat for online communication</li>\n<li>New “Item Descriptions” option reveals the full functionality of items you’ve previously collected</li>\n<li>New leaderboards for online play</li>\n<li>Over 700 different items to collect</li>\n<li>More than 300 enemy types and bosses</li>\n<li>Multiple difficulty settings, game modes, branching paths and endings to discover</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Details</h3>\n<p><strong>Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch 2<br><strong>Players:</strong> 1 to 4<br><strong>Release Date:</strong> November 19, 2026<br><strong>Developer:</strong> Nicalis Inc., Edmund McMillen <br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Rating_Icon_-_40967_-_The_Binding_of_Isaac_Repentance.png?v=1760640428\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><br>© 2025-2026 Nicalis, Inc.</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"><br></div>\n<hr>\n<p> </p>",
