    {
      "id": 8868398498049,
      "title": "Youtooz Collectibles Dogma Vinyl Figure",
      "handle": "the-binding-of-isaac-youtooz-dogma-figure",
      "body_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>THE STATIC TURNS DOGMATIC </span><br>\n</h3>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>One of the scariest bosses from The Binding of Isaac series has been produced as a Youtooz Collectibles vinyl figure, with its mouth taking the shape of the trademark Youtooz crescent. The figure is covered with reflective glitter, representing the TV static from which Dogma emerges in The Binding of Isaac: Repentance. </span><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">FEATURES</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Sculpted design includes drippy umbilical cord</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Ships in a matte, embossed, protective outer sleeve and a custom sized plastic protector </span>\n</li>\n<li><span>Officially licensed The Binding of Isaac merchandise</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">DETAILS</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Figure includes base and stands 3.5\" tall</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Covered with reflective glitter bits and assembled by hand </span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>#4 in the Youtooz Binding of Isaac Collection</span><span></span>\n</li>\n<li><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Estimated ship date: Jan 2026</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span><br><br></span></p>",
