    {
      "id": 8868398170369,
      "title": "Youtooz Collectibles The Lost Vinyl Figure",
      "handle": "youtooz-collectibles-the-lost-vinyl-figure",
      "body_html": "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>THE UNLOCKABLE APPARITION</span><br>\n</h3>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>The latest character in the Youtooz Binding of Isaac Collection is The Lost, the ghostly spectre who begins the game with no health... and is also unable to acquire health. This is the Youtooz figure for Isaac fans who enjoy a challenge, because when you purchase it, you have a 1-in-6 chance of getting the rare Tainted Lost \"chase\" figure instead. </span><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">FEATURES</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Sculpted design includes three-dimensional spectral tears</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Ships in a matte, embossed, protective outer sleeve and a custom sized plastic protector </span>\n</li>\n<li><span>Officially licensed The Binding of Isaac merchandise</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">DETAILS</h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Figure includes base, hovering at approximately 3\" tall</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Made from vinyl and assembled by hand</span><br>\n</li>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>#5 in the Youtooz Binding of Isaac Collection</span><br>\n</li>\n<li><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Estimated ship date: Jan 2026</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span><br><br></span></p>\n</div>",
