      "title": "Pastry Panic!",
      "handle": "pastry",
      "body_html": "<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Pastry_Panic_store_1.png?v=1761604357\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Pastry_Panic_store_2.png?v=1761604671\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; text-align: left;\">\n<p><span> <img style=\"position: relative; left: 0; top: 0;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/Pastry_Panic_store_3.png?v=1761604680\"> <br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><em>Pastry Panic!</em> is a co-op dessert factory cooking game. Up to four adorable bunnies team up to mix batter, bake cakes, chop fruit, shave ice, operate machinery… and whatever else the recipes call for!</p>\n<p>Hop to it and juggle tasks in a chaotic kitchen, scamper to meet your daily quotas in time and coordinate your team’s efforts to achieve pastry perfection.</p>\n<p>Just try to avoid slip-ups, and watch the clock—no bunny likes working overtime!</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Team up in local or online multiplayer for up to four people</li>\n<li>30+ playable characters to choose from</li>\n<li>Play through 60+ challenging stages</li>\n<li>Process ingredients with over a dozen different machines</li>\n<li>Bake cakes and other tasty delights from lots of different recipes</li>\n<li>Help your team navigate obstacles and the bustle of a factory floor</li>\n<li>Earn stars based on your team’s performance each day</li>\n<li>Coordinate and control two separate bunnies in single-player mode</li>\n<li>Select a “theme” and play in Arcade Mode with teammates from all over the world</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<h3>Details</h3>\n<p><strong>Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch 2<br><strong>Players:</strong> 1 to 4<br><strong>Release Date:</strong> Q3 2026<br><strong>Developer:</strong> Megatent Inc., Nicalis Inc. <br><br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/esrb2_60026e59-1295-42d9-8019-e58efd44c292.png?v=1613715703\" width=\"171\" height=\"81\"></p>\n<br>© 2025-2026 Nicalis, Inc. / Megatent Inc.<br>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>\n<p><span><br></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>\n<p><span><br></span></p>",
