      "id": 9077281349,
      "title": "1001 Spikes",
      "handle": "1001-spikes",
      "body_html": "<!--Put First header here-->\n<h3>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span> YOU CAN DIE A THOUSAND DEATHS!</span>\n</h3>\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UJUHdANllZs?controls=0\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>The son of a famous adventurer, Aban Hawkins must avoid an endless gauntlet of devious traps and dastardly hazards while exploring the Ukampa Ruins in South America.</p>\n<p>Sharp spikes, poison darts, falling blocks and flamethrowers are among the deadly obstacles that Aban will have to overcome in order to reach the Door of Poko-Mum and learn the truth about his missing father.</p>\n<p>A throwback to the most challenging 8-bit platformers, 1001 Spikes requires intense concentration, constant memorization and flawless timing. You start the game with 1,001 lives, and you may end up losing every last one of them before you make it to the Golden Shrine!</p>\n<h3> 10TH ANNIVERSARY VERSION BONUSES</h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><img style=\"top: 0px; right: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/1001SpikesAnniversary_1024x1024.png?v=1727735126\"></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Authentic Key of Ukampa keychain in branded gift box with foam insert</li>\n<li>Keychain unscrews to reveal a secret compartment, just like in the game</li>\n<li>Exclusive Remix Soundtrack audio CD</li>\n<li>Retro two-color reversible English/Japanese instruction manual</li>\n<li>Reversible cover sheet insert with retro box art </li>\n<li>Keepsake outer box with debossed faux leather cover and magnetic closure\n<p><br></p>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Order restrictions</strong>: <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Customers are limited to one item total per console, regardless of address. This item will only be shipped to the billing address. It will not ship to a freight forwarder or PO Box. </p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"> Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li>100+ carefully crafted levels filled with dangerous pitfalls and endless surprises</li>\n<li>Well over a dozen playable characters, nearly all of whom have different abilities</li>\n<li>Authentic 8-bit sprite graphics and chiptunes echoing the peak era of platform games</li>\n<li>Separate “high jump” and “low jump” buttons for precision control</li>\n<li>Shop for purchasing upgrades, power-ups and locked features with in-game currency</li>\n<li>\"Music Box” and “Cutscene Theater” modes for listening to in-game music or reviewing cutscenes</li>\n<li>\"The Golden Vase\" Arcade Mode with multiplayer support for up to four players (PS4 version only)<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"> Details</h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<p><strong>Players:</strong> 1 (1 to 4 on PlayStation 4)<br><strong>Release Date:</strong> TBA<br><strong>Developer:</strong> Nicalis, Inc. / 8bits fanatics </p>\n<p>© 2024 Nicalis Inc.<br><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1525/5574/files/ESRB_1001_Spikes.png?v=1727199782\" width=\"280\" height=\"129\"><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span><br><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>",
